Added stories for the four listing variations — Grid, Highlight, Carousel and Media Carousel — with a shared fixture shaped like a `@querystring-search` response. Each renders inside the `block listing <variation>` wrapper the listing block produces on a page, because `_listing.scss` is scoped to `body .block.listing`: without it none of the variation styling applies. This is what makes the restored focus outlines observable, and it closes the largest remaining gap in Storybook coverage. @ericof
